] text-[10px] leading-none text-ink-800 hover:bg-honey-100\" aria-label=\"Recentre hive (Ctrl+0)\" title=\"Recentre hive (Ctrl+0)\">0</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"surface-panel h-8 w-8 rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] text-[10px] leading-none text-ink-800 hover:bg-honey-100\" aria-label=\"Fit swarm\">⤢</button></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-end justify-center pb-24\"><p class=\"type-mono-meta text-meta\">No agents yet — submit a prompt to create the first run.</p></div><div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"sr-only\"></div></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center p-4\"><section aria-label=\"HyperAgent hive chat core\" class=\"pointer-events-auto surface-panel w-[min(600px,92%)] rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3\" style=\"box-shadow: var(--shadow-e3); transition: box-shadow 160ms;\"><header class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><div><div class=\"type-heading-h3 text-ink-900\">Hive AI Assistant</div><div class=\"type-mono-meta text-meta\">Pinned to hive centre · Connected</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"type-mono-meta rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-hairline px-2 py-1 text-ink-800 hover:bg-honey-100\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Unpin chat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"type-mono-meta rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-hairline px-2 py-1 text-ink-800 hover:bg-honey-100\" aria-label=\"Hide the chat core (the hive stays)\">Close</button></div></header><div class=\"mt-2 max-h-[42vh] min-h-[72px] overflow-y-auto rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] bg-panel-alt px-2 py-2\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"HyperAgent hive chat core\"><p class=\"type-body-l text-ink-500\">Drop a repository into the core hive and the HyperAgent maps its architecture before a single worker spawns.</p></div><form class=\"mt-2 flex items-start gap-2\"><label class=\"sr-only\" for=\"composer\">Type your prompt...</label><textarea id=\"composer\" class=\"type-mono-code min-h-[44px] min-w-0 flex-1 resize-y rounded-[var(--radius-md)] border border-hairline bg-panel-alt px-3 py-2 text-ink-900\" placeholder=\"Type your prompt...\" rows=\"2\"></textarea><button type=\"submit\" class=\"type-label rounded-[var(--radius-button)] bg-honey-300 px-4 py-2 text-ink-900 hover:bg-honey-400 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\" disabled=\"\">Submit prompt</button></form><p class=\"type-mono-meta mt-1 text-meta\">Enter submits · Shift+Enter newline · Ctrl+0 recentres</p></section></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 border-t border-hairline bg-panel px-3 py-2\"><span class=\"type-mono-meta text-meta\">role:</span><select class=\"type-mono-meta rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-hairline bg-panel-alt px-2 py-1 text-ink-800\" aria-label=\"WORKER: Re-route\"><option value=\"\">—</option></select><button type=\"button\" class=\"type-label rounded-[var(--radius-button)] border border-hairline px-3 py-1.5 text-ink-900 hover:bg-honey-100 disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" title=\"No active run\">Spawn sub-hive</button><select class=\"type-mono-meta rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-hairline bg-panel-alt px-2 py-1 text-ink-800\" aria-label=\"Re-route\"><option value=\"\">Re-route</option></select><button type=\"button\" class=\"type-label rounded-[var(--radius-button)] border border-hairline px-3 py-1.5 text-ink-900 hover:bg-honey-100 disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Select a running worker first\">Re-route</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"type-label rounded-[var(--radius-button)] border border-hairline px-3 py-1.5 text-ink-900 hover:bg-honey-100 disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\">Cancel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"type-label rounded-[var(--radius-button)] border border-signal px-3 py-1.5 text-signal hover:bg-recessed disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\">Kill worker</button><span class=\"type-mono-meta ml-auto text-meta\" aria-live=\"polite\">Nothing here yet</span></div><footer class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-hairline bg-panel-alt px-4 py-2\"><label class=\"type-label text-ink-500\" for=\"scrubber\">Routing state</label><input id=\"scrubber\" min=\"0\" max=\"0\" step=\"1\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Time-travel scrubber\" class=\"h-1 flex-1 accent-[var(--color-honey-500)]\" type=\"range\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"type-mono-meta text-meta\" aria-live=\"polite\">No run history yet</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"type-mono-meta rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-hairline px-2 py-1 text-ink-800 hover:bg-honey-100\" disabled=\"\">live</button></footer></main><aside aria-label=\"Library panel\" class=\"hidden w-[260px] shrink-0 flex-col gap-4 border-l border-hairline bg-panel p-3 xl:flex\"><div><div class=\"type-label text-ink-500\">Project</div><div class=\"type-mono-code mt-1 truncate text-ink-900\">HiveMind AI</div><div class=\"type-mono-meta text-meta\">01a1b44d</div></div><div><div class=\"type-label text-ink-500\">ACTIVE AGENTS · 0</div><p class=\"type-mono-meta mt-1 text-meta\">No active agents</p></div><div><div class=\"type-label text-ink-500\">TEMPLATES</div><ul class=\"mt-1 space-y-1\"><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"type-mono-code w-full rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-hairline bg-panel-alt px-2 py-1 text-left hover:bg-honey-100\">Content Writer</button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"type-mono-code w-full rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-hairline bg-panel-alt px-2 py-1 text-left hover:bg-honey-100\">Data Analyst</button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"type-mono-code w-full rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-hairline bg-panel-alt px-2 py-1 text-left hover:bg-honey-100\">Code Reviewer</button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"type-mono-code w-full rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] border border-hairline bg-panel-alt px-2 py-1 text-left hover:bg-honey-100\">Chatbot</button></li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-auto\"><p class=\"type-mono-meta mb-2 text-meta\" title=\"A specimens carry one off-token grey spinner in 03/load/spinner; A is fixing it — never adopt that colour. | Pixel-layout fidelity is UNVERIFIED/needs_human (boards are text-layer; contact sheets are shadow sprites). | S25 code-diff review stays DECISION-GATED; no DIFF_* command is implemented.\">FigCraft A+B exports accepted by UI watchdog (PASS-WITH-NOTES, FAIL 0). Values come from the token module, never sampled pixels; pixel-layout fidelity remains UNVERIFIED.</p><p class=\"type-mono-meta text-meta\">Drag a worker onto another super-agent to re-route its context stream live.</p></div></aside><div aria-live=\"assertive\" aria-label=\"Refusals and errors\" class=\"pointer-events-none fixed right-4 top-4 z-50 flex w-[min(440px,92vw)] flex-col gap-2\"></div></div></div>\n  \n\n</body></html>",
